+# Proposal
+
+## Why
+
+The desk needs to see at a glance what can still be rented. Today it can only try `book` per item and see it fail.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `availability(query)` to the rental service, where `query` is `{ start, end, kind? }`.
+- It returns the ids of equipment free for the whole period, sorted; restricted to `kind` when given, any kind otherwise.
+- An invalid period or an invalid `kind` throws, consistent with the other operations. Read-only: nothing is reserved.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+- `rental-booking`: adds an availability query requirement.
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/rental.ts` (service interface and implementation), `src/index.ts` (export the query type), `src/rental.test.ts`, README.
